url https://api.openaq.org/v3/sensors/{station}/measurements
note Global flat measurements endpoint removed (v2 → 410); values only per-sensor — resolved by P09 flatten+filter fanout, now live in phi/sources.φ (diffusion). AWS S3 archive is bulk parquet (no live JSON).

# ── NOAA CDO (NCEI) ──
